scope.text:
This standard provides:
a) a systematic methodology for evaluating the power performance of tidal current energy converters (TECs) that produce electricity for utility scale and localized grids;
b) a definition of TEC rated power and rated water velocity;
c) a methodology for the production of the power curves for the TECs in consideration; and
d) a framework for the reporting of results.

