This Indian Standard (First Revision) which is identical to IEC 60204-32 : 2023 'Safety of machinery - Electrical equipment of machines - Part 32: Requirements for hoisting machines' issued by the International Electrotechnical Commission (IEC) was adopted by the Bureau of Indian Standards on the recommendation of the Safety of Machinery - Electrotechnical Aspects Sectional Committee and approval of the Electrotechnical Division Council.
